From 048f537e7c18c2b9aab1b2349877c25d06d03949 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Feb 2026 11:28:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: Add D1 domain for STM32MP23 family

Add a new power domain D1 domain to manage device assigned to CA35
and working only in Run1, managed by CLUSTER_PD and CpuIdle,
but without limitation for wakeup for S2IDLE, managed by EXTI1
and RET_PD.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I69d937a929c3e745f9d11db74298f0e1d91f0c2b
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/434117
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/536980
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
